\ read-file / write-file / append-file / file-exists? — whole-file, no handles.

\ write then read round-trips
"hello" "/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" write-file
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" read-file . cr            \ hello
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" read-file "hello" = . cr  \ 1
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" read-file size . cr       \ 5

\ write-file truncates an existing file
"hi" "/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" write-file
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" read-file size . cr       \ 2

\ append-file adds to the end
" there" "/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" append-file
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" read-file . cr            \ hi there
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" read-file size . cr       \ 8

\ binary-safe: an embedded newline round-trips
"a
b" "/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" write-file
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" read-file size . cr       \ 3

\ empty file
"" "/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" write-file
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" read-file size . cr       \ 0

\ file-exists? — access(F_OK); follows symlinks, any file type
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" file-exists? . cr         \ 1
"/tmp/lf_no_such_file_zzz" file-exists? . cr   \ 0
"/tmp" file-exists? . cr                       \ 1  (a directory exists)

\ errors
"/tmp/lf_no_such_dir_zzz/nope" read-file       \ cannot open
42 "/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" write-file             \ content not a string
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" 42 append-file            \ path not a string
42 file-exists?                                \ path not a string

clear
\ open-file ( path -- stream ): the file as a read-only stream; read-line /
\ read / read-available / close work as on pipe ends.
"first
second
tail" "/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" write-file
"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" open-file to lines
lines read-line . cr                           \ first
lines read-line . cr                           \ second
lines read . cr                                \ tail (unterminated final run)
lines read-line none? . cr                     \ 1  end of input
lines close

"/tmp/lf_fileio.txt" open-file to peeking
[ peeking ] 5 wait-readable size . cr          \ 1  a file is always readable
peeking read-available byte-size . cr          \ 17 the whole content waits
peeking close

\ errors
lines read-line                                \ stream is closed
"/tmp/lf_no_such_file_zzz" open-file           \ cannot open
42 open-file                                   \ path not a string
